{"id": "B2-35:14", "en": "The service is becoming increasingly popular.", "p": [["S", "The service", "hizmet"], ["V", "is becoming increasingly popular", "giderek daha popüler oluyor"]]}
{"id": "B2-35:15", "en": "The journey takes roughly two hours.", "p": [["S", "The journey", "yolculuk"], ["V", "takes", "sürer"], ["T", "roughly two hours", "yaklaşık iki saat"]]}
